#env
.env
.env.*
# Vite bakes VITE_ values into the public bundle at build time, so the frontend
# build needs them in the repo. Only public values belong here: the basemap URL
# and attribution, and the assignment-package verification (public) key. Private
# keys and API secrets stay in Base44 Secrets, read server-side only.
!.env.production
# Canvas basemap config: loaded in every Vite mode, public-by-design values only.
!.env

